<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>There’s a feast spread in the Bible,</l><l>For His word is man’s true food.</l><l>How I long to eat more, for I,</l><l>Have tasted the Lord is good.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>So much wealth is in the Bible,</l><l>Mine its words for precious ore.</l><l>In it I find all God’s riches,</l><l>They become my treasure store!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Words of love are in the Bible,</l><l>Unveiling the Author’s heart.</l><l>These words draw and woo His seekers,</l><l>Making them His counterpart.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
